<title>FRANCE: Thomson sale could be in early 1997.</title>
<headline>Thomson sale could be in early 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of electronics group Thomson SA could take place in early 1997 because the procedures could possibly not be completed before the year-end as planned.</p>
<p>&quot;The privatisation commission has let it be known that it will not take a decision until after the European Commission has rendered its verdict,&quot; a spokeswoman for the French Finance Ministry said.</p>
<p>The European Commission on Monday said it was looking into the planned acquisition by South Korea's Daewoo Electronics of Thomson's Thomson-Multimedia.</p>
</text>
